{% comment %}
  Extended Warranty — Cart upsell.

  Pure UI: reads the live Shopify cart, shows each eligible product's own
  warranty plans (never mixed with another product's plans), and adds/
  removes/syncs the warranty line item via the native AJAX Cart API. If a
  product already has a linked warranty line, its selector is replaced with
  a "Protection added" confirmation + Remove action. If the plans API fails
  or a product has no eligible plans, that product's section is simply
  omitted — the cart, its totals, and checkout are never affected.
{% endcomment %}
<div class="wpc-cart-warranty" data-shop="{{ shop.permanent_domain }}" hidden></div>

